---
import ProofLayout from '../layouts/ProofLayout.astro';
---
<ProofLayout title="Two directions. One practice." description="Compare two HTML and CSS design directions for Mitchell Miller's portfolio.">
<h1>Two directions.<br/>One practice.</h1><p class="deck">Data science. Design. Engineering. Growth. The same work, presented through two different visual systems.</p>
<div class="choices"><section><p class="kicker">A / INDEPENDENT PRACTICE</p><h2>Clear. Direct. Editorial.</h2><p>A sharp project index, strong typography and a clear path from your experience to a conversation.</p><a class="button" href="/themes/editorial/">Explore direction A</a><iframe src="/themes/editorial/" title="Independent Practice design preview" loading="lazy"></iframe></section><section><p class="kicker">B / RESEARCH ATELIER</p><h2>Curious. Technical. Expressive.</h2><p>A darker studio for the intersection of research, design and engineering, with the lab as a visible part of the practice.</p><a class="button" href="/themes/atelier/">Explore direction B</a><iframe src="/themes/atelier/" title="Research Atelier design preview" loading="lazy"></iframe></section></div>
<section class="proof"><h2>The content is HTML.</h2><p>The proof pages deliver complete case-study text, an article and resume links before JavaScript runs. These establish the content templates while the visual direction is reviewed.</p><a href="/proof/">Inspect the content proofs</a></section>
</ProofLayout>
<style>.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;margin-top:45px}.choices>section{min-width:0}.choices h2{font-size:29px;margin:12px 0}.choices p{font-size:16px}.kicker{font-size:12px!important;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700}.button{display:inline-block;padding:11px 16px;background:#19282d;color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:23px;font-size:15px}iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:690px;border:1px solid #cbd0cb;background:white}.proof{border-top:1px solid #cbd0cb;margin-top:48px}@media(max-width:850px){.choices{grid-template-columns:1fr}iframe{height:660px}}</style>
